{"resource": {"name": "Sonoma County Sheriff's Office Incident Data", "id": "3rsj-iche", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "Sheriff\u2019s incident reports are generated after either of two events 1) a citizen has reported an event/crime and a deputy has substantiated that a report is necessary or 2) a deputy has witnessed an event/crime in progress. These incident reports represent a wide spectrum of law enforcement activity from informational reports to serious crime reports. For more information about this dataset please go to the About button and click on the Attachment. For an interactive map of this data, please visit: http://www.raidsonline.com/?address=4787%20Old%20Redwood%20Hwy%20Santa%20Rosa,%20CA.", "attribution": "Sonoma County Sheriff's Office", "attribution_link": "http://www.sonomasheriff.org", "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-09-11T08:29:40.000Z", "createdAt": "2015-05-19T22:19:55.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-05-10T22:22:38.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2022-09-11T08:29:40.000Z", "columns_name": ["incident type", "date time", "incident number", "id", "location (state)", "agency code", "agency", "location (address)", "Zip Codes", "location (city)", "location (zip)", "Census Tract Boundary", "upload", "location", "intersection", "city", "location type"], "columns_field_name": ["incident_type", "date_time", "incident_number", "id", "location_state", "agency_code", "agency", "location_address", ":@computed_region_dig5_f3vy", "location_city", "location_zip", ":@computed_region_xw9s_pz78", "upload", "location", "intersection", "city", "location_type"], "columns_datatype": ["Text", "Calendar date", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Calendar date", "Point", "Text", "Text", "Text"], "columns_description": ["Incident category for the type of incident reported.", "Date and time that the incident was reported to have taken place. For incidents such as burglary when there is a time 